<div id="2025-01-15-fix-project-selection-todo-filtering" class="cl-entry">
<h3>Fix for Project Selection in Todo Filtering</h3>
&#91;% debug %&#93;
&#91;% IF c.session.debug_mode == 1 %&#93;
    &#91;% PageVersion %&#93;
    &#91;% "Debugging HostName: " _ HostName %&#93;
